Follow AGENTS.md. Use the maintainer's configured Git identity. Do not override
author or committer with an AI tool identity. Do not add AI Co-authored-by,
Made-with, generated-by or session trailers. Preserve genuine human credits.
Repository hooks reject these identities; main also requires Commit authorship.
